# Copy to .env (untracked, and excluded from the Docker build context) only if
# you run local Claude inside Docker. See docs/local-claude.md.
#
# Enable the local-only Claude integration in the dev server:
# CLAUDE_PROVIDER=subscription
#
# Long-lived Claude *subscription* token from `npm run claude:token`
# (Anthropic's `claude setup-token`). Never commit a real value.
# CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=
#
# Optional model override for Claude Code, e.g. claude-sonnet-5
# CLAUDE_MODEL=
#
# Optional per-request timeout (ms, default 480000) and debug timing logs
# CLAUDE_TIMEOUT_MS=
# CLAUDE_DEBUG=1
#
# There is intentionally no ANTHROPIC_API_KEY here: the local integration only
# uses your Claude subscription and ignores API keys.
